{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231150","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231150","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1023115001:1":{"text":"Here we are! <hpy>Miss Roli—</hpy>!","source_cn":"我们到了！<hpy>罗丽叶小——！</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2013EE89DC97F298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023115002:1":{"text":"Shh! Be quiet! Let the night breeze take my message to Roliet.","source_cn":"嘘！别声张！让晚风给罗丽叶捎个口信吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82C7203629EA6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1023115002":{"text":"Shh! Be quiet! Let the night breeze take my message to Roliet.","source_cn":"嘘！别声张！让晚风给罗丽叶捎个口信吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82C7203629EA6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023115003:2":{"text":"\"Whisper in a zephyr's grace, convey my plea with tender trace—How I yearn for her embrace, <hpy>like a fish out of water, lost in space. On the edge of self-control's base, I ache in longing's endless chase.</hpy>\"","source_cn":"“给我一阵清风替我告诉她——我多想念她，<hpy>宛如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB838B087EFF51D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023115004:1":{"text":"\"Grant me a breeze, my message carry, do implore. Of my deep devotion, for her, I cannot ignore. <hpy>Her name etched upon my heart, forever to adore. Love her like instinct, to my very core.\"</hpy>","source_cn":"给我一阵清风替我告诉她——我多爱慕她，<hpy>她姓名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C491DC9694DD679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023115005:1":{"text":"\"In her presence, mundane days transform with grace. Into unending wonders, simple moments leave a magical trace.\"","source_cn":"若与她同在，再平凡的日常，也会化作连绵不绝的奇迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF5C2207E376247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023115006:1":{"text":"\"Without her by my side, even the grandest view fades to shadows, losing its vibrant hue.\"","source_cn":"若无她相伴，再美的风景，也变得黯然无光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DF44EB0F151ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1023115007:1":{"text":"\"Alongside the lake, where our love's tale entwined. I wandered back and forth, reliving when our fates aligned.\"","source_cn":"我在初定情缘的映湖旁徘徊，反反复复，流连忘返。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860FD0C76657C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023115008:1":{"text":"\"When distant from her, the stars cease to ignite. For in this world, no radiance matches her light so bright.\"","source_cn":"与她相隔时，星光也不再闪烁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22F987ECC1638D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023115009:0":{"text":"<hpy>\"All things connected to her, in their splendor take flight. Miracles abound in her presence, day or night.\"</hpy>","source_cn":"<hpy>因为世上未曾有比她更璀璨的星星。一切与她相关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF450325AA949BB9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1023115010:1":{"text":"...<hpy>That was amazing. Are you sure it's your first time writing a love letter?</hpy>","source_cn":"……<hpy>写得不错啊，你真的是第一次写情书？</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FFA1AB2D3A6E11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1023115011:1":{"text":"Natural talent, I guess.","source_cn":"这就是天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1011032388F74AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1023115011":{"text":"Natural talent, I guess.","source_cn":"这就是天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1011032388F74AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:10231150